<!-- 16. SYSTEM TESTING & RESULTS -->
<h1>10. SYSTEM TESTING & RESULTS</h1>
<p>The system was rigorously tested using an unseen test subset of the MRI dataset. The EfficientNet-B3 model successfully achieved an 87.5% classification accuracy across the four categories.</p>

<h2>10.1 Classification Performance</h2>
<p>When an image of a Glioma was uploaded, the system correctly identified it with >95% confidence. The interface successfully rendered the corresponding radar charts mapping the distribution of probabilities against Meningioma and Pituitary classes, proving that the Softmax layer functions properly in a live production environment.</p>

<h2>10.2 Explainable AI (Grad-CAM) Validation</h2>
<p>The Grad-CAM module was tested to ensure the gradient flow was unbroken. The system successfully generated heatmaps utilizing the Jet colormap. The warmest regions (red/yellow) on the overlay consistently aligned with the dense mass regions (the tumor) visible in the original MRI, proving that the AI is localizing the correct physiological anomaly rather than memorizing background noise.</p>
<br>
